  "notes": "Cause code X / category Other governs despite narrative describing a procedural/tracking-program weakness (theme captures this). No stated operable backup system was named for the TIP shear valve penetration isolation function during the event window (Condition C requires isolation via the flow path itself, not an alternate system), so no BACKED_UP_BY edge was created. This is a supplement (rev 01) to an original LER; no distinct previous-occurrence LER was cited by number in the narrative, so no SIMILAR_TO/stub LER node was created. Three physically distinct shear-valve components (A/D/E trains) modeled separately per rule 5/8 guidance on distinct entities; squib cartridge modeled as a single generic Component with PART_OF into each valve since it is explicitly a subcomponent."
